    "enUS": {
      "description": "You've got that \"Windshaper\" air about you. Something about how I can feel a tiny bit of static on my skin when near someone spirit-touched that gives it away. Before I properly put you to work around here, you should check in with our resident Windshaper elder, Illaya Amberwind. She's just outside, near the center of town.\r\n\r\nOh, and check in with Coriella Calmbreeze as well, she runs the local inn and can provide lodging and supplies, should you need them.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Speak with Illaya Amberwind",
          "type": "monster"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Speak with the Innkeeper",
          "type": "monster"
